WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.168
This morning when the

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.604
police commissioner and I spoke on

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.407
our morning briefing with the other team,

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:12.245
we were clear that tomorrow is a day

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.747
that's going to draw a great deal

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:15.448
of attention to our city.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:15.882
And we know

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:18.051
there are many questions around

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:19.886
the movement of the city.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.255
And we want to make sure that we send

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:22.989
a very clear,

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.593
loud message, as the deputy mayor stated

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.696
in New York City, is always, always ready

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.098
We know that this is a city

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.600
where our

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.069
NYPD and other law enforcement entities

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.171
must be prepared in any given moment

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.507
for anything to happen in this city

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:41.541
to start.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.643
I want to make it clear,

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:44.744
the commissioner has stated

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:45.745
over and over again

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.514
there has been no specific,

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.883
specific, credible threats to our city

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.251
at this time.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.053
Then on New Yorkers should go on

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.155
with their regular activities.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.389
That means going to work,

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.191
going to school,

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.192
we're going to do our

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.760
job as we always do.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:02.462
If you

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.663
use the drive which

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.765
state and take public transportation,

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.267
it is easy to get around

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:08.935
on public transportation

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:11.037
because we expect some disruptions

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.472
in additional traffic.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:13.473
There's a great deal

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:14.474
of additional traffic

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.076
that may come in the city

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.910
and there will be street

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.777
closes

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:20.280
near the courts and throughout the city.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.450
While there may be some rabble rousers

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.351
thinking about coming

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.486
to our city tomorrow.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:29.556
A message is clear and simple.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.325
Control yourselves.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.760
New York City is our home,

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.127
not a

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:37.864
playground for your misplaced anger.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.533
We are the safest large city in America

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.102
because we respect

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.504
the rule of law in New York City.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:47.740
And although we have no specific threats,

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.276
people like Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.512
who is known to spread

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:55.315
misinformation and hate speech of

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:57.450
she stated she's coming to town

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:58.718
Why are you in town?

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.087
Be on your best behavior.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:02.722
As always,

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:03.990
we would not allow violence

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.259
or vandalism of any kind.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:09.229
And if one is caught participating

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:11.097
in any act of violence,

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.332
they will be arrested

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:14.134
and held accountable.

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:16.636
No matter who you are.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.371
And I want to, again,

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:19.806
thank the police department,

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.040
the commissioner,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.575
for their response

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.211
and for the necessary preparation

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:27.180
as we deal with this major

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.948
historical potential event

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.416
that would take place in the city.

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.618
This time, I'd like to introduce

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:32.318
the police commissioner

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.219
of the city of New York.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:35.255
Thank you, Mr.

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:35.989
Mayor.

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:36.990
Afternoon, everyone.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.925
Thank you for being here.

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:39.726
As always,

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.661
the NYPD is prepared to ensure

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.329
that everyone is able to have

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:43.897
their voices

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:45.198
heard peacefully

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:45.999
while exercising

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:48.001
their First Amendment rights.

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.136
We do this work in close collaboration

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.437
with our federal, state

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.039
and local partners

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.474
because keeping our city safe

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:57.177
is absolutely a collective effort.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.111
As the mayor stated,

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:58.978
there are no

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.547
credible or specific threats

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:02.916
to New York City at this time.

00:03:02.916 --> 00:03:03.416
New Yorkers

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.451
may see an increased police presence

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:06.786
in parts of the city

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:07.921
and should anticipate

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:09.622
intermittent road closures

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.090
over the next few days,

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.259
particularly in Manhattan.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.260
To avoid delays,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.061
I too, urge

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:15.828
everyone to use

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:18.164
mass transit when possible.

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:19.232
As I said,

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.568
our job is to facilitate and safeguard

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.669
the rights of people

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:24.204
to express themselves

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.004
and those going

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:27.207
about their daily activities.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:30.043
But I will remind everyone that violence

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:30.810
and destruction

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.046
are not part of legitimate,

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.414
lawful expression,

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.949
and it will never be tolerated

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:37.350
in our city.

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:39.452
The people we serve know this,

00:03:39.452 --> 00:03:40.620
just as they know

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.455
that the NYPD will be out there

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:44.791
today, tomorrow and every day

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.826
to make sure that they are safe.

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:48.861
Thank you, Mr. Mayor. Sure.

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:50.430
Sure.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:50.930
Well, we'll

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.000
take some questions, questions travel

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.301
as more details read

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:58.438
or anything else before

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:01.307
So the permitting is happening

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.209
is actually done through city hall.

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:05.545
But I will say that anyone who protest

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.980
is expected to express themselves

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.681
peacefully and orderly

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.850
rest assured in the rest of the power is

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:13.353
being raised once

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:13.886
that incident

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:16.389
is still under investigation at this time

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.091
of the year. Mr.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:21.327
Mayor, have you noticed any

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:23.363
order for here at the airport?

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:27.066
A lot of people on notice that are

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.168
coming here for this event.

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:31.471
Any criminal matter? Or nothing.

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:32.705
We value our relationship

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:33.306
with our partners

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.007
and we're in constant

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:34.807
communication with them.

00:04:34.807 --> 00:04:36.709
So if they do see an influx of people

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.710
or something out of the ordinary,

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.911
they will contact us.

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:39.512
At this time,

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.446
we don't see that happening,

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.081
but we will have real time information if

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:42.649
that does occur.

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:45.518
Anyone have specific

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:47.887
questions for you to share with the mayor

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:50.223
about where these

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.692
communities certain

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.327
how many blocks around the corner

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:57.697
should be closed for any minute?

00:04:58.231 --> 00:04:59.365
Would that information

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:00.300
shared with the public?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:00.900
So they're going to be

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.135
rolling road closures.

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.002
I'm sure you can understand

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:04.304
based on the sensitivity of it,

00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:05.104
it's going to be moving,

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:05.705
but we will make sure

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:06.472
we have enough officers

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.041
to facilitate transport

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.275
throughout the city.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.210
There is one area close to Trump Tower

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.879
that will have a road that is closed

00:05:12.879 --> 00:05:14.847
just to facilitate his transport.

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:15.548
But beyond that,

00:05:15.548 --> 00:05:16.749
there will be rolling road closures

00:05:16.749 --> 00:05:17.684
intimately through the city.

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:18.518
We're trying to have a minimal

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:21.154
amount of intrusion into city life.

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:23.122
I want to ask

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:25.058
what additional measures is

00:05:25.058 --> 00:05:26.592
the NYPD is taking

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:29.195
to try

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.898
also other members of his office?

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.867
We take any threats

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.803
or concerns of our elected officials

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:38.738
and anyone in the city very seriously.

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:39.672
So we have provided

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:40.773
some assistance in that regard.

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:41.641
And we are investigating

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:43.509
any threats that may be made to the DEA

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:46.813
or any of his his staff that the times

00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:49.816
we're going to bring him in the

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:50.216
York.

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:51.517
As you know, a

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:52.919
number of laws were passed

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:56.222
when we went into having sensitive zones

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:57.256
and restricted zones

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:58.324
It's actually an easy felony

00:05:58.324 --> 00:05:59.459
to carry in some of those zones,

00:05:59.459 --> 00:06:00.860
even if you have a license.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.627
Some of those zones

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:03.162
include courthouses,

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:04.197
federal buildings

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:05.565
and First Amendment activity.

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:06.899
So we're not going to move those

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:07.667
I think responsible

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:08.167
gun ownership

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:09.235
requires that, you know what,

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:11.003
the laws are where you are protesting

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:12.438
and we expect everyone to adhere to ours.

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:16.209
Well, going back to police presence,

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:19.212
how many officers do you expect

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:19.979
