00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:22.081
I mean,

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:24.217
how have they come in

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:26.686
and basically told you what to do or,

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:28.020
you know, how much control

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.389
they're having over security?

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:30.857
We work with the Secret Service

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:33.025
all the time. These are our partners.

00:06:33.025 --> 00:06:34.260
I won't go into how many numbers

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.428
of police officers will be on the street,

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:36.062
but we will have enough

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.730
to facilitate our mobile units

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.165
if we need to respond to anything.

00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:40.233
But this is a collaborative effort

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:41.801
with our partners in the Secret Service

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:44.504
and make sure our

00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:48.508
personnel are able

00:06:48.508 --> 00:06:50.376
to stand there to cancel the dinner.

00:06:50.376 --> 00:06:51.811
So you're listening there to Keyshawn

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:52.779
for the New York City

00:06:52.779 --> 00:06:54.046
Police Department

00:06:54.046 --> 00:06:56.048
commissioner, along with New York Mayor

00:06:56.048 --> 00:06:57.984
Eric Adams, giving a security briefing

00:06:57.984 --> 00:06:59.519
about the arrangements

00:06:59.519 --> 00:07:03.156
ahead of tomorrow's historic day here in

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:04.624
in the United States

00:07:04.624 --> 00:07:05.324
and in New York,

00:07:05.324 --> 00:07:06.859
where Donald Trump will be arraigned

00:07:06.859 --> 00:07:07.960
and after his indictment

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:08.861
on criminal charges.

00:07:08.861 --> 00:07:10.296
We heard some headlines.

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:12.298
Others say there's a sending a clear

00:07:12.298 --> 00:07:13.099
and loud messages.

00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:14.267
They're not going to tolerate

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:15.468
any sort of violence

00:07:15.468 --> 00:07:18.471
or there's no specific or credible threat

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:19.172
that there will be

00:07:19.172 --> 00:07:20.673
any sort of violence tomorrow.

00:07:20.673 --> 00:07:23.276
And they also issued a warning of sorts

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:24.377
