00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:31.350
while running at leading

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:34.020
a protest tomorrow in New York City.

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:34.520
Let's go right

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.288
to CNN's

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.956
chief law enforcement and intelligence

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:38.624
analyst John Miller,

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.493
as well as the CNN senior law enforcement

00:07:40.493 --> 00:07:42.361
analyst, Chief Ramsey.

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:43.996
So, John,

00:07:43.996 --> 00:07:45.565
the headline, no specific

00:07:45.565 --> 00:07:46.833
credible threat to the city.

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:47.934
What's your reaction?

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:49.569
That's what we

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:51.971
were expecting to hear in that

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:54.574
They've been looking at everything

00:07:54.574 --> 00:07:56.075
from social media posts

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.176
to bomb threats

00:07:57.176 --> 00:07:58.945
that have been called in

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:00.313
the week before last.

00:08:00.313 --> 00:08:02.815
And and the entire threat picture.

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:03.883
And none of it

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:05.251
rises to anything

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:06.152
where they can say

00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:07.119
this is something

00:08:07.119 --> 00:08:07.787
where we think

00:08:07.787 --> 00:08:08.721
there's something behind it,

00:08:08.721 --> 00:08:10.623
where it's actually going to occur.

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:12.024
That's the good news.

00:08:12.024 --> 00:08:13.860
The important part from an intelligence

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.194
standpoint is

00:08:15.194 --> 00:08:16.596
you have to understand

00:08:16.596 --> 00:08:17.663
that you're not going to know

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:19.432
