00:08:19.432 --> 00:08:20.867
or what lurks in the shadows.

00:08:20.867 --> 00:08:24.003
So the bifurcated posture there is

00:08:24.136 --> 00:08:26.072
they're watching the threat traffic,

00:08:26.072 --> 00:08:27.373
but they're also prepared

00:08:27.373 --> 00:08:28.641
