00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:31.644
Which is

00:08:31.644 --> 00:08:33.145
they're not only following the threats,

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:34.847
but they're investigating

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:35.648
even threats

00:08:35.648 --> 00:08:37.049
that are posted in social media

00:08:37.049 --> 00:08:37.717
to say

00:08:37.717 --> 00:08:39.519
who's on the other end of that threat?

00:08:39.519 --> 00:08:40.720
Do they need to be interviewed

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.755
were they serious about the threat?

00:08:42.755 --> 00:08:44.090
Do they have the capability

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.124
to carry it out?

00:08:45.124 --> 00:08:45.791
And so far,

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:46.959
they haven't seen anything

00:08:46.959 --> 00:08:48.060
that crosses the line.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.595
But again, they're prepared

00:08:49.595 --> 00:08:51.330
and they're prepared and chief

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.132
to the mayor mentioned

00:08:53.132 --> 00:08:54.033
Marjorie Taylor

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.067
Greene called on her

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:55.601
and others

00:08:55.601 --> 00:08:58.070
to, quote, be on your best behavior.

00:08:58.104 --> 00:08:59.372
What do you take away from

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.573
that stark warning

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:04.343
Well, what I take away is it

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:05.745
doesn't matter who you are.

00:09:05.745 --> 00:09:06.879
If you break the law,

00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:09.782
if you engage in any act of violence,

00:09:10.116 --> 00:09:12.151
you will suffer the consequences. Period.

00:09:12.151 --> 00:09:15.121
And we learned from January six,

00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:16.355
obviously, that

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:17.823
these things can't turn bad.

00:09:17.823 --> 00:09:20.092
But having said that,

00:09:20.092 --> 00:09:22.929
it sounds like the NYPD is prepared.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.132
I have no doubt that they are

00:09:26.132 --> 00:09:27.600
in a position to be able to deal

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.735
with whatever may come up

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:32.805
both in terms of just the regular control

00:09:32.838 --> 00:09:36.208
of what takes place on the various sites,

00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:38.177
but also having mobile units

00:09:38.177 --> 00:09:39.278
that can move from point A

00:09:39.278 --> 00:09:41.280
to point B very rapidly.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:41.914
You know, the mayor

00:09:41.914 --> 00:09:42.848
and the commissioner

00:09:42.848 --> 00:09:44.450
both mentioned something that I think

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:45.952
people lose sight of.

00:09:45.952 --> 00:09:46.819
Often times,

00:09:46.819 --> 00:09:48.020
because we get so focused

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.323
on the security itself.

00:09:50.323 --> 00:09:52.325
But for the average New Yorker,

00:09:52.825 --> 00:09:53.859
they're not interested in

00:09:53.859 --> 00:09:54.627
what's going on.

00:09:54.627 --> 00:09:55.728
They just want to get from point

00:09:55.728 --> 00:09:56.462
A to point B,

00:09:56.462 --> 00:09:57.463
they want to get to the bank,

00:09:57.463 --> 00:09:59.265
they want to get to the grocery store.

00:09:59.265 --> 00:10:01.000
So you have to balance things

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.568
and keep people informed

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:04.070
when you have street closures

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:06.005
and things of that nature

00:10:06.005 --> 00:10:08.074
so that they can move freely

00:10:08.074 --> 00:10:11.410
or as freely as they can around the city.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:12.778
And that's a balancing act

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:14.013
in and of itself.

00:10:14.013 --> 00:10:14.981
You try to get people

00:10:14.981 --> 00:10:17.183
to take public transportation,

00:10:17.183 --> 00:10:18.684
but that's not always you know,

00:10:18.684 --> 00:10:19.952
what people choose to do.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.187
So it's a balancing act.

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:23.155
So they've got a lot of moving parts

00:10:23.155 --> 00:10:23.856
there dealing with

00:10:23.856 --> 00:10:24.657
what's going on

00:10:24.657 --> 00:10:27.460
in terms of the ex-president, him

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:29.261
surrendering to various sites

00:10:29.261 --> 00:10:31.397
that need to be dealt with.

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:33.833
But there's also day to day business

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:35.501
that goes on in the city.

00:10:35.501 --> 00:10:36.435
All your resources

00:10:36.435 --> 00:10:37.637
cannot be in one place.

00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:38.571
They're going to be handling

00:10:38.571 --> 00:10:39.839
everything that takes place in

00:10:39.839 --> 00:10:40.706
New York on that day.

